      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When everything feels overwhelmingly heavy, the idea of continuing the struggle seems unbearable, and that feeling of wanting to let go is understandable. Please know that these feelings are symptoms of deep distress, not accurate reflections of your worth or your place in the world. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline or mental health professional. Help is available, and you do not have to carry this weight alone.",
